 "evidence_use": "No prior research records were retrieved. This means there is no existing project work directly addressing the reliability of a defense's effect on opponent H2-H1 change as a team trait. Therefore, this question appears to be novel within the project's documented history, requiring a de novo assessment without the benefit of prior findings, failures, or established limitations specific to this exact formulation.",
